  "reasoning": "The facts describe a scheme where the defendant set up a company and an online platform offering high returns, required members to pay a guarantee deposit, and recruited members through a multi‑level referral system. The defendant earned profit from the downline members and expanded the network, which constitutes a pyramid (illegal multi‑level marketing) operation. Under Chinese criminal law this behavior is defined as the crime of organizing and leading a pyramid scheme (组织、领导传销活动罪). No other crimes are indicated in the facts.",
